OL,3,GNEWSACity library could switch with art
OL,4,Agallery building
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheffield's Central Library could be
OL,7,Fset to move 100 yards across the road
OL,8,Fto a new home at a reimagined Millenium
OL,9,FGallery.
OL,11,FThe proposals will be put to the
OL,12,Fcouncil's Strategy and Resources Policy
OL,13,FCommittee later this month.
OL,15,FThe plan would see the historical
OL,16,FCentral Library building on Surrey
OL,17,FStreet transformed into a destination
OL,18,Fart gallery with the return of Graves
OL,19,FGallery as well as the current
OL,20,FMillenium Gallery exhibitions and new
OL,21,Fart spaces.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
